<Style backgroundColor="#ffffff" bodyColor="#ffffff" bodyXPadding="24" bodyYPadding="32" textBaseColor="#17202a" textLinkColor="#ec3750" buttonBodyColor="#ec3750" buttonTextColor="#ffffff" buttonBorderRadius="6" />
<H3 paddingBottom="8">Hack Club</H3>
<H1 paddingBottom="16">We couldn't validate your NDA</H1>
<Paragraph fontSize="16" lineHeight="165" paddingBottom="16">Hi {data.signer_fullName},</Paragraph>
<Paragraph fontSize="16" lineHeight="165" paddingBottom="16">We weren't able to validate the NDA you sent us. If this keeps happening, please sign a new one — it only takes a few minutes.</Paragraph>
<Button paddingTop="8" paddingBottom="24" href="{data.nda_importUrl}">Sign a new NDA</Button>
<Paragraph fontSize="13" lineHeight="160" paddingBottom="16">Or paste this link into your browser:<Br />{data.nda_importUrl}</Paragraph>
<Paragraph fontSize="14" lineHeight="160" paddingBottom="8">If you think this is a mistake, write to <Link href="mailto:team@hackclub.com">team@hackclub.com</Link>.</Paragraph>
<Divider paddingTop="16" paddingBottom="16" />
<Paragraph fontSize="12" lineHeight="170"><Strong>The Hack Foundation</Strong>, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit<Br />212 Battery St., Shelburne, VT 05401, USA<Br />This message concerns a legal agreement. Keep it for your records.</Paragraph>
